status/1834364070813970548</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/1834364070813970548\">https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/1834364070813970548</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1834367398859719101</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1834367398859719101\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-12T23:04:03Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1834367916139000224":{"a":"<p>@BrianRoemmele Palmitic oil causes cells to activate the inflammatory response. This can be useful if you&#x27;re infected. But you also need a poly unsaturated fatty acid to turn off the swelling. Otherwise you just keep swelling and swelling until it&#x27;s killing you.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1834367398859719101\">https://x.com/i/status/1834367398859719101</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1834367916139000224</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1834367916139000224\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-12T23:06:06Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1834376746646360536":{"a":"<p>@DaveBlocked @BrianRoemmele 😂 Right. I&#x27;ll make a note. &quot;Idiots don&#x27;t realize they can ignore advice they don&#x27;t agree with.&quot; (insert scribbling noises) t.co</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1834369936677847309\">https://x.com/i/status/1834369936677847309</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DaveBlocked/status/1834369936677847309\">https://x.com/DaveBlocked/status/1834369936677847309</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com